#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kteatime.appdata.xml:12
msgid "KTeaTime is a handy timer for steeping tea. No longer will you have to guess at how long it takes for your tea to be ready. Simply select the type of tea you have, and it will alert you when the tea is ready to drink."
msgstr "KTeaTime je praktičan mjerač vremena za namakanje čaja. Više ne morate nagađati koliko je vremena potrebno da čaj bude spreman. Jednostavno odaberite vrstu čaja, a program će vas obavijestiti kada bude spreman za piće."
